# Records docs/demo.gif. Run from the repo root:  vhs docs/demo/demo.tape
Output docs/demo.gif
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 19
Set Width 1180
Set Height 760
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 0
Hide
Type "export PS1='' && clear && python3 docs/demo/play.py"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
Sleep 19s
